msgstr ""

#: src/Tools/RetrieveContext.php:39
msgid "Single-call RAG retrieval: given a question, returns grounded context from the knowledge graph (nodes, edges, related content) ready to paste directly into an AI prompt. Combines full-text node search with multi-hop graph traversal and optional vector similarity search for semantically rich results. Returns nodes, edges, and a pre-formatted context_text string. Use this before generating content to ground responses in your site's knowledge."
msgstr ""

